{"html":"<h1 id=\"core-language-benchmark\">Core language benchmark</h1>\n<p>1 compile runs, 1 fresh-process runs, and 100 raw runtime runs. Values shown as mean ± sample standard deviation in ms. Compile warmups: 1. Process warmups: 1. Raw runtime warmups: 10.</p>\n<p>Matched rows keep the same algorithm. Idiomatic rows allow each ecosystem's normal optimized implementation; inspect the linked source before comparing them.</p>\n<h2 id=\"compile-time-ms\">Compile time (ms)</h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll benchmark-table\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Scrollable table\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">operation</th><th scope=\"col\">mode</th><th scope=\"col\">data</th><th scope=\"col\">size</th><th scope=\"col\">count</th><th scope=\"col\">VKF</th><th scope=\"col\">C++</th><th scope=\"col\">Rust</th><th scope=\"col\">Zig</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>spectral norm by power method</td><td>idiomatic</td><td>dense f64 vectors and implicit matrix</td><td>large</td><td>500</td><td>32077.706 ± 0.000</td><td>217.965 ± 0.000</td><td>280.928 ± 0.000</td><td>479.202 ± 0.000</td></tr><tr><td>fannkuch-redux permutations</td><td>matched</td><td>fixed integer sequence and indexed mutation</td><td>large</td><td>9</td><td>165.452 ± 0.000</td><td>439.423 ± 0.000</td><td>458.351 ± 0.000</td><td>454.245 ± 0.000</td></tr><tr><td>five-body symplectic integration</td><td>matched</td><td>five bodies with f64 position, velocity, mass, and final kinetic checksum</td><td>large</td><td>50000</td><td>460.399 ± 0.000</td><td>292.987 ± 0.000</td><td>330.945 ± 0.000</td><td>512.056 ± 0.000</td></tr><tr><td>serial combined</td><td>matched</td><td>three matched kernels in one deterministic program</td><td>large</td><td>3</td><td>23721.661 ± 0.000</td><td>434.394 ± 0.000</td><td>421.991 ± 0.000</td><td>545.274 ± 0.000</td></tr><tr><td>parallel combined</td><td>matched</td><td>three independent large kernels; one scalar checksum</td><td>large</td><td>3</td><td>23977.937 ± 0.000</td><td>322.709 ± 0.000</td><td>368.855 ± 0.000</td><td>494.225 ± 0.000</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h2 id=\"runtime-ms\">Runtime (ms)</h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll benchmark-table\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Scrollable table\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">operation</th><th scope=\"col\">mode</th><th scope=\"col\">data</th><th scope=\"col\">size</th><th scope=\"col\">count</th><th scope=\"col\">VKF</th><th scope=\"col\">C++</th><th scope=\"col\">Rust</th><th scope=\"col\">Zig</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>spectral norm by power method</td><td>idiomatic</td><td>dense f64 vectors and implicit matrix</td><td>large</td><td>500</td><td>72.167 ± 0.000</td><td>42.897 ± 0.000</td><td>71.027 ± 0.000</td><td>42.337 ± 0.000</td></tr><tr><td>fannkuch-redux permutations</td><td>matched</td><td>fixed integer sequence and indexed mutation</td><td>large</td><td>9</td><td>28.824 ± 0.000</td><td>43.330 ± 0.000</td><td>48.945 ± 0.000</td><td>43.224 ± 0.000</td></tr><tr><td>five-body symplectic integration</td><td>matched</td><td>five bodies with f64 position, velocity, mass, and final kinetic checksum</td><td>large</td><td>50000</td><td>29.279 ± 0.000</td><td>33.800 ± 0.000</td><td>29.330 ± 0.000</td><td>30.551 ± 0.000</td></tr><tr><td>serial combined</td><td>matched</td><td>three matched kernels in one deterministic program</td><td>large</td><td>3</td><td>89.148 ± 0.000</td><td>73.911 ± 0.000</td><td>69.584 ± 0.000</td><td>73.969 ± 0.000</td></tr><tr><td>parallel combined</td><td>matched</td><td>three independent large kernels; one scalar checksum</td><td>large</td><td>3</td><td>99.596 ± 0.000</td><td>61.651 ± 0.000</td><td>59.109 ± 0.000</td><td>63.663 ± 0.000</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h2 id=\"vkf-internal-compiler-core-time-including-optimizer-ms\">VKF internal compiler-core time, including optimizer (ms)</h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll benchmark-table\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Scrollable table\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">operation</th><th scope=\"col\">data</th><th scope=\"col\">size</th><th scope=\"col\">count</th><th scope=\"col\">VKF</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>spectral norm by power method</td><td>dense f64 vectors and implicit matrix</td><td>large</td><td>500</td><td>32028.384 ± 0.000</td></tr><tr><td>fannkuch-redux permutations</td><td>fixed integer sequence and indexed mutation</td><td>large</td><td>9</td><td>80.406 ± 0.000</td></tr><tr><td>five-body symplectic integration</td><td>five bodies with f64 position, velocity, mass, and final kinetic checksum</td><td>large</td><td>50000</td><td>437.349 ± 0.000</td></tr><tr><td>serial combined</td><td>three matched kernels in one deterministic program</td><td>large</td><td>3</td><td>23671.118 ± 0.000</td></tr><tr><td>parallel combined</td><td>three independent large kernels; one scalar checksum</td><td>large</td><td>3</td><td>23941.549 ± 0.000</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h2 id=\"vkf-empirical-optimizer-time-within-compilation-ms\">VKF empirical optimizer time within compilation (ms)</h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll benchmark-table\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Scrollable table\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">operation</th><th scope=\"col\">data</th><th scope=\"col\">size</th><th scope=\"col\">count</th><th scope=\"col\">VKF</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>spectral norm by power method</td><td>dense f64 vectors and implicit matrix</td><td>large</td><td>500</td><td>341.811 ± 0.000</td></tr><tr><td>fannkuch-redux permutations</td><td>fixed integer sequence and indexed mutation</td><td>large</td><td>9</td><td>27.109 ± 0.000</td></tr><tr><td>five-body symplectic integration</td><td>five bodies with f64 position, velocity, mass, and final kinetic checksum</td><td>large</td><td>50000</td><td>196.087 ± 0.000</td></tr><tr><td>serial combined</td><td>three matched kernels in one deterministic program</td><td>large</td><td>3</td><td>595.262 ± 0.000</td></tr><tr><td>parallel combined</td><td>three independent large kernels; one scalar checksum</td><td>large</td><td>3</td><td>518.706 ± 0.000</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h2 id=\"raw-kernel-runtime-ms\">Raw kernel runtime (ms)</h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll benchmark-table\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Scrollable table\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">operation</th><th scope=\"col\">mode</th><th scope=\"col\">data</th><th scope=\"col\">size</th><th scope=\"col\">count</th><th scope=\"col\">VKF</th><th scope=\"col\">C++</th><th scope=\"col\">Rust</th><th scope=\"col\">Zig</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>spectral norm by power method</td><td>idiomatic</td><td>dense f64 vectors and implicit matrix</td><td>large</td><td>500</td><td>64.766 ± 28.240</td><td>17.744 ± 5.861</td><td>20.216 ± 8.202</td><td>22.044 ± 26.128</td></tr><tr><td>fannkuch-redux permutations</td><td>matched</td><td>fixed integer sequence and indexed mutation</td><td>large</td><td>9</td><td>10.710 ± 3.098</td><td>25.822 ± 7.275</td><td>20.977 ± 4.755</td><td>25.248 ± 6.822</td></tr><tr><td>five-body symplectic integration</td><td>matched</td><td>five bodies with f64 position, velocity, mass, and final kinetic checksum</td><td>large</td><td>50000</td><td>8.068 ± 15.475</td><td>6.116 ± 10.795</td><td>6.360 ± 15.635</td><td>11.260 ± 28.291</td></tr><tr><td>serial combined</td><td>matched</td><td>three matched kernels in one deterministic program</td><td>large</td><td>3</td><td>83.205 ± 19.558</td><td>50.872 ± 11.908</td><td>46.853 ± 12.463</td><td>51.312 ± 13.566</td></tr><tr><td>parallel combined</td><td>matched</td><td>three independent large kernels; one scalar checksum</td><td>large</td><td>3</td><td>94.013 ± 43.685</td><td>51.892 ± 18.530</td><td>51.570 ± 32.910</td><td>51.491 ± 25.297</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h2 id=\"vkf-raw-kernel-runtime-ratio\">VKF raw-kernel runtime ratio</h2>\n<p>VKF time divided by the peer time on the same pinned CPU; below 1× means VKF is faster.</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll benchmark-table\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Scrollable table\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">operation</th><th scope=\"col\">VKF / C++</th><th scope=\"col\">VKF / Rust</th><th scope=\"col\">VKF / Zig</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>spectral norm by power method</td><td>3.650×</td><td>3.204×</td><td>2.938×</td></tr><tr><td>fannkuch-redux permutations</td><td>0.415×</td><td>0.511×</td><td>0.424×</td></tr><tr><td>five-body symplectic integration</td><td>1.319×</td><td>1.269×</td><td>0.717×</td></tr><tr><td>serial combined</td><td>1.636×</td><td>1.776×</td><td>1.622×</td></tr><tr><td>parallel combined</td><td>1.812×</td><td>1.823×</td><td>1.826×</td></tr></tbody></table></div>","headings":[{"level":1,"title":"Core language benchmark","id":"core-language-benchmark"},{"level":2,"title":"Compile time (ms)","id":"compile-time-ms"},{"level":2,"title":"Runtime (ms)","id":"runtime-ms"},{"level":2,"title":"VKF internal compiler-core time, including optimizer (ms)","id":"vkf-internal-compiler-core-time-including-optimizer-ms"},{"level":2,"title":"VKF empirical optimizer time within compilation (ms)","id":"vkf-empirical-optimizer-time-within-compilation-ms"},{"level":2,"title":"Raw kernel runtime (ms)","id":"raw-kernel-runtime-ms"},{"level":2,"title":"VKF raw-kernel runtime ratio","id":"vkf-raw-kernel-runtime-ratio"}],"examples":[],"source":"benchmarks/core-comparison/results/windows-x64-045-five-workloads-100.md","route":"benchmarks/core-windows-0.4.5.html","releaseCatalog":{"schema":"vektor-flow/release-catalog-v1","latest":"0.4.5","latestBrowserRuntime":{"version":"0.4.5","url":"https://vektorflow.org/runtimes/v0.4.5/vkf-shared-compiler.wasm?sha256=0146e4996ebb505f9fc4808f4825282ad5783ee9021e738a19ad568aaf3e366c"},"releases":[{"version":"0.4.0","tag":"v0.4.0","status":"published","browserRuntimeWasm":null,"benchmarkTier":"feature","benchmark":{"summary":"Full 1,000-run native performance gate.","browser":null,"evidenceUrl":"https://vektorflow.org/downloads/v0.4.0/man